## 实现方案

### 1. 滚动比例计算引擎

移植原始 DiscrollView.onScrollChanged() 算法：

```dart
void _onScroll(double scrollOffset) {
  final viewportHeight = scrollMetrics.viewportDimension;
  final halfHeight = viewportHeight / 2;
  final totalHeight = scrollMetrics.maxScrollExtent + viewportHeight;

  for (int i = 1; i < children.length; i++) {
    final childTop = _childPositions[i];
    final childHeight = _childHeights[i];
    final absoluteTop = childTop - scrollOffset;

    double ratio;
    if (totalHeight - (childTop + childHeight) < childHeight + halfHeight) {
      // 剩余空间不足——top 触发
      if (absoluteTop <= viewportHeight) {
        ratio = clamp(visibleGap(absoluteTop, viewportHeight) / childHeight, 0.0, 1.0);
      } else {
        ratio = -1; // reset
      }
    } else {
      // 剩余空间足够——center 触发
      if (absoluteTop <= halfHeight) {
        ratio = clamp(visibleGap(absoluteTop, halfHeight) / childHeight, 0.0, 1.0);
      } else {
        ratio = -1;
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### 2. 变换渲染

```dart
Widget _applyTransforms(Widget child, DiscrollveConfig config, double ratio) {
  if (ratio < 0 || ratio < config.threshold) return child; // 未触发或重置
  final r = (ratio - config.threshold) / (1.0 - config.threshold); // withThreshold
  Widget result = child;
  if (config.alpha) result = Opacity(opacity: r, child: result);
  if (config.scaleX || config.scaleY) result = Transform.scale(scale: r, ...);
  if (config.translation > 0) result = Transform.translate(offset: _calcTranslation(r), ...);
  if (config.fromColor != -1 && config.toColor != -1) {
    result = Container(color: Color.lerp(from, to, r), child: result);
  }
  return result;
}
```

### 3. 关键特性

- 首个子 Widget 自动填充 viewport 全高（LayoutBuilder + state）
- 位掩码 Translation 方向组合，运行时 assert 检测对立方向冲突
- withThreshold 数学函数与原始 Java 实现字节等价
- 公开 ScrollController 支持外部程序化控制滚动位置
